{"key":"enterprise/T1195.001","id":"T1195.001","name":"Compromise Software Dependencies and Development Tools","domain":"enterprise","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T1195","tactics":["initial-access"],"platforms":["Linux","macOS","Windows"],"environments":["cloud-hosted-endpoint","onprem"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may manipulate software dependencies and development tools prior to receipt by a final consumer for the purpose of data or system compromise. Applications often depend on external software to function properly. Popular open source projects that are used as dependencies in many applications, such as pip and NPM packages, may be targeted as a means to add malicious code to users of the dependency. This may also include abandoned…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1195/001","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--191cc6af-1bb2-4344-ab5f-28e496638720","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.622Z","source_object_version":"1.3","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0039","name":"File Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0039","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--2b3bfe19-d59a-460d-93bb-2f546adc2d2c","page":"telemetry/DC0039/"},{"id":"DC0059","name":"File Metadata","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0059","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--639e87f3-acb6-448a-9645-258f20da4bc5","page":"telemetry/DC0059/"},{"id":"DC0016","name":"Module Load","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0016","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--c0a4a086-cc20-4e1e-b7cb-29d99dfa3fb1","page":"telemetry/DC0016/"},{"id":"DC0078","name":"Network Traffic Flow","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0078","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--a7f22107-02e5-4982-9067-6625d4a1765a","page":"telemetry/DC0078/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"id":"DC0020","name":"Process Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0020","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--d5fca4e4-e47a-487b-873f-3d22f8865e96","page":"telemetry/DC0020/"},{"id":"DC0063","name":"Windows Registry Key Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0063","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--da85d358-741a-410d-9433-20d6269a6170","page":"telemetry/DC0063/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0009","name":"Supply-chain tamper in dependencies/dev-tools (manager→write/install→first-run→egress)","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009","stix_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--ec870f2d-bba3-43f9-95b8-c2f85678dba4","relationship_id":"relationship--f21676c2-dc39-4d2e-b551-5ed654dddef3"}],"analytics":[{"id":"AN0021","name":"Analytic 0021","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0021","guidance":"Adversary manipulates dependencies/dev tools used by developers or CI: a package manager (npm/yarn/pnpm, pip/pipenv, nuget/dotnet, chocolatey/winget, maven/gradle) or a compiler/IDE downloads or restores content; files are written under project paths and execution paths (node_modules, packages, .nuget, .gradle, .m2, %AppData%\\npm, %UserProfile%\\.cargo\\bin, temp build dirs). First run of newly written components triggers scripts (preinstall/postinstall), shell/PowerShell spawning, or loader DLLs, followed by network egress to non-approved registries/CDNs.","platforms":["Windows"],"strategy_id":"DET0009"},{"id":"AN0022","name":"Analytic 0022","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0022","guidance":"Developer or CI invokes package managers/compilers (apt/yum + build-essential, npm/yarn/pnpm, pip/pip3, gem, cargo, go, maven/gradle). These write executable or script files into PATH or project dirs and immediately execute embedded lifecycle hooks (preinstall/postinstall, setup.py, npm scripts) that spawn shells or curl/wget, followed by egress to unfamiliar registries or domains.","platforms":["Linux"],"strategy_id":"DET0009"},{"id":"AN0023","name":"Analytic 0023","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0023","guidance":"Developer tools (Homebrew, pip, npm/yarn, Xcode builds) install or update dependencies; new Mach-O or scripts appear under /usr/local, /opt/homebrew, ~/Library/Application Support, project dirs (node_modules/.bin, venv/bin). First run spawns sh/zsh/osascript/curl and new outbound flows; Gatekeeper/AMFI may flag unsigned components.","platforms":["macOS"],"strategy_id":"DET0009"}],"log_sources":[{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=1","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0021","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0021","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0016","component":"Module Load","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=7","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0021","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0021","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0016/"},{"component_id":"DC0039","component":"File Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=11","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0021","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0021","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0039/"},{"component_id":"DC0063","component":"Windows Registry Key Modification","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=13, 14","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0021","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0021","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0063/"},{"component_id":"DC0059","component":"File Metadata","name":"WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-CodeIntegrity/Operational","channel":"Invalid/Unsigned image when developer tool launches newly installed binaries","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0021","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0021","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0059/"},{"component_id":"DC0078","component":"Network Traffic Flow","name":"NSM:Flow","channel":"First-time outbound connections to package registries or unknown hosts immediately after restore/build","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0021","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0021","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0078/"},{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"auditd:SYSCALL","channel":"execve","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0022","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0022","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0020","component":"Process Modification","name":"auditd:SYSCALL","channel":"rename, chmod","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0022","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0022","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0020/"},{"component_id":"DC0059","component":"File Metadata","name":"journald:package","channel":"dpkg/apt or yum/dnf transaction logs (install/update of build tools)","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0022","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0009#AN0022","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0059/"},{"component_id":"DC0078","component":"Network Traffic Flow","name":"NSM:Flow","channel":"First-time egress to new registries/CDNs post-install/build","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0022","source_url":"https://attack.mit